    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_natural_dyestuffs; land_basis=terrestrial_forest): Heading is explicitly a dyewood (fustic, Brazil wood, sapan, Nicaragua wood, red/Guinea wood, braziletto); filed with Dye Woods Logwood (htc:0096) rather than building timber. Layer-1 observations: 56 rows, 1856–1869. Series: HCPP_Annual Statement of Trade ×56. Units: Tons ×51; Number ×5. Top routes: World → United Kingdom ×9; Other Parts → United Kingdom ×9; Philippine Islands → United Kingdom ×9; Siam → United Kingdom ×5."@en ;
